            {
              "name": "body: \"    Complex& Complex::operator*=(const Complex &num)\\n    {\\n        double real = m_real;\\n        m_real = (m_real * num.m_real) - (m_imaginary * num.m_imaginary);\\n        m_imaginary = (real * num.m_imaginary) + (m_imaginary * num.m_real);\\n        \\n        return (*this);\\n    }\\n\""
